<title>BULGARIA: FRANKFURT FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 1.</title>
<headline>FRANKFURT FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 1.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar was fixed at 1.8477</p>
<p>marks in Frankfurt on Friday from 1.8325 marks on Thursday.</p>
<p>Other main currencies are fixed against the mark at the</p>
<p>following rates (previous in brackets):</p>
<p>    USD   1.8477 (1.8325)  </p>
<p>    GBP   3.0277 (2.9945)  </p>
<p>    CHF 121.8750 (121.1800)</p>
<p>    JPY   1.5541 (1.5502)  </p>
<p>    ATS  14.2120 (14.2120) </p>
<p>The exchange rates are used in Bulgaria for accounting,</p>
<p>statistical and customs purposes and are valid for Monday,</p>
<p>August 4.</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 911 88</p>
</text>
